Real `lspci -nn -mm` and `ubuntu-drivers devices` outputs (Ubuntu 24.04), used by shell/test/gpu-drivers.unit.mjs
and, in dev mode, by the installer's graphics driver step (AURORA_GPU_FIXTURE=<directory name>).
  lspci.txt           lspci -nn -mm
  ubuntu-drivers.txt  ubuntu-drivers devices (empty: no driver offered)
  lsmod.txt           lsmod (optional)
  nvidia-version.txt  /proc/driver/nvidia/version (optional: the nvidia module is loaded)
  sb-state.txt        mokutil --sb-state (optional)
